  DialogueText: You walk into the employee section of the building. The place is
    filled with cubiles filled with ruined computers. Papers from old reports litter
    the floor. As you look around, you see the Mr Handy blueprint through a window
    looking into the senior manager's office. The last obstacle, how will you get
    inside?
